  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solar Home Systems and Electric Cooking Stoves Project in Senegal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We are developing alternative cooking solutions to wood and coal, electric mobility, rural electrification. To date we have carried out the pilot project for clean cooking with bioethanol in Senegalese households. In this project we have marked 1820 units of ethanol stoves. We offer solar kits from 1 to 50 Kwc coupled with electric cooking equipment to help fight against electricity poverty in Senegal.</narrative>
  </description>
